  "FLINK-13819": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-13819",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Done",
    "title": "Introduce RpcEndpoint State",
    "description": "To better reflect the lifecycle of RpcEndpoint, we suggest to introduce its state:\r\n * created\r\n * started\r\n * stopping\r\n\r\nWe can use the state e.g. to make decision about how to react on API calls if it is already known that the RpcEndpoint is terminating, as required e.g. for FLINK-13769.",
